# Title: WinSxS Executable File Creation By Non-System Process
# ID: 34746e8c-5fb8-415a-b135-0abc167e912a
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-05-11
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects the creation of binaries in the WinSxS folder by non-system processes
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((filemod_name:C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\* AND filemod_name:*.exe) AND -(((process_name:C:\\Windows\\Systems32\\* OR process_name:C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\* OR process_name:C:\\Windows\\WinSxS\\*))))
